# NOTE: dist/ is intentionally NOT ignored here. This is a JS GitHub Action —
# consuming workflows run dist/index.js directly with no build step on their
# end, so the bundled output must be committed. Run `npm run build:action`
# and commit the result before tagging a release. `sharp`'s native binary
# lives in node_modules and is NOT bundled (see scripts/build-action.mjs) —
# see README "Publishing" notes for how that gets shipped alongside dist/.
